# 3. PRESERVE EXISTING SCHEMA

Existing JSONotes JSON MUST continue working.

Example:

```json
{
  "title": "Closures",
  "definition": "A closure retains lexical scope.",
  "concepts": [
    "Lexical environment",
    "Outer variables"
  ],
  "warning": "Closures can retain memory."
}
```

Existing explicit fields must have higher priority than inference.

Priority:

```text
Explicit JSONotes field
        ↓
Known normalization
        ↓
DO NOT infer that same field again
```

Track consumed fields/paths.

No duplicate blocks.

