# 7. KEY NORMALIZATION

Create deterministic key normalization.

These:

```text
keyPoints
KeyPoints
key_points
key-points
KEY_POINTS
Key Points
```

should produce comparable tokens:

```text
["key", "points"]
```

Handle:

* camelCase
* PascalCase
* snake_case
* kebab-case
* spaces
* repeated separators
* capitalization

Examples:

```text
thingsToAvoid
→ ["things", "to", "avoid"]

browser_support
→ ["browser", "support"]

example-code
→ ["example", "code"]

KEY_TAKEAWAYS
→ ["key", "takeaways"]
```

Keep original key too.

