# PHASE 9 DEFINITION OF DONE

Phase 9 is complete when:

1. Existing JSONotes schema still works.
2. Arbitrary JSON keys are accepted.
3. Known fields remain the high-confidence fast path.
4. Known fields are not processed twice.
5. Nested JSON is discoverable.
6. Discovery recursion is bounded.
7. Total discovered fields are bounded.
8. Array processing is bounded.
9. camelCase keys are normalized.
10. PascalCase keys are normalized.
11. snake_case keys are normalized.
12. kebab-case keys are normalized.
13. Keys can be humanized.
14. FieldSignals exists.
15. Semantic aliases are centralized.
16. Classification considers key semantics.
17. Classification considers value shape.
